 "notes": "Cliopatria has no row; four new keyframes. The page treats the Sanjak of Smederevo/Pashalik of Belgrade from 1459 to 1817; this dossier covers only the Ottoman restoration of 1739 to the Principality of 1817, because the earlier Ottoman centuries belong to the Ottoman state and 1718-1739 to the Habsburg Kingdom of Serbia, which has its own dossier. Disagreements: the page says the sanjak ended in 1817 yet describes the Ottoman unit as \"nominally until 1830\"; it gives no month for the Treaty of Belgrade; Smederevo or Belgrade as seat. Gaps: the extent (no nahiye list), the 1833 annexation of six nahiyes (page silent, so the 1833 enlargement of the principality is not here), the pashas of 1739-1787 and 1807-1813, the first rebel conquests of 1804-1806. The uprisings are recorded against the dossier \"serbs\" (written by eu-18-f). The Habsburg Kingdom of Serbia of 1718-1739 has its own dossier (kingdom-of-serbia-1718-1739). Wikidata id null (unreachable).",
